  table_tennis: `<circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8"/><line x1="2.2" y1="10" x2="17.8" y2="10" stroke-width="0.9"/><line x1="16" y1="16" x2="20.5" y2="21" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="21.5" cy="4" r="2"/>`,
